        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPW-300, Large Traditional Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe love the Traditional 3 Inch Ring Pull for its classic look and how easy it is to install. It is available in 5 finishes including satin nickel, polished brass, and oil rubbed bronze. Although it has a traditional feel, this wire ring pull has a modern square mount to keep it contemporary. It is this paring that will ensure its timelessness; and since it is made out of solid brass, it will be sure to stand the test of time even with heavy use.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Smaller <a href=\"/products/traditional-2-inch-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpw-200\">Traditional 2\" Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RPW300 Wire Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout Diameter: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
